.TH proc_kallsyms 5 2026\-02\-08 "Linux man\-pages (未リリース)" 
.SH 名前
/proc/kallsyms \- kernel exported symbols
.SH 説明
.TP 
\fI/proc/kallsyms\fP (Linux 2.5.71 以降)
This holds the kernel exported symbol definitions used by the \fBmodules\fP(X)
tools to dynamically link and bind loadable modules.  In Linux 2.5.47 and
earlier, a similar file with slightly different syntax was named \fIksyms\fP.
.SH 歴史
.TP 
\fI/proc/ksyms\fP (Linux 1.1.23\[en]2.5.47)
\fI/proc/kallsyms\fP 参照。
.SH 関連項目
\fBproc\fP(5)
